     <td><para unique="1046471">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1046472">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+193063"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046474">Multiply scalar single precision floating-point value from xmm1 and xmm2, add to xmm3/m32 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046442">EVEX.LLIG.66.0F38.W0 B9 /r </para>
      <para unique="1046443">VFMADD231SS xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m32{er}</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046447">B</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046449">V/V</para>
